<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Student Portfolio | Om Adwani</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f5f7fb;
  --dark:#111827;
  --text:#172033;
  --muted:#64748b;
  --primary:#4f46e5;
  --secondary:#06b6d4;
  --card:#ffffff;
  --border:#e5e7eb;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  color:var(--text);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 5%,rgba(79,70,229,.12),transparent 28%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%,rgba(6,182,212,.12),transparent 25%),
    var(--bg);
  line-height:1.65;
}
.container{width:min(1100px,92%);margin:auto}

nav{
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:50;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);
  backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.nav{
  min-height:64px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
}
.logo{
  font-size:20px;
  font-weight:900;
  color:var(--dark);
}
.navlinks{
  display:flex;
  gap:25px;
}
.navlinks a{
  text-decoration:none;
  color:var(--text);
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:700;
}
.navlinks a:hover{color:var(--primary)}

.hero{
  min-height:650px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  color:white;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111827,#1e1b4b 55%,#164e63);
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.hero:before,.hero:after{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
  border-radius:50%;
}
.hero:before{width:650px;height:650px;right:-260px;top:-250px}
.hero:after{width:400px;height:400px;left:-240px;bottom:-230px}

.hero-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1.4fr .6fr;
  gap:50px;
  align-items:center;
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
}
.badge{
  display:inline-block;
  padding:7px 13px;
  border-radius:999px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
  font-size:13px;
}
h1{
  font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,78px);
  line-height:1;
  letter-spacing:-3px;
  margin:20px 0;
}
.hero h1 span{
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#93c5fd,#67e8f9);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;
  color:transparent;
}
.hero p{
  color:#dbeafe;
  max-width:700px;
  font-size:18px;
}
.buttons{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}
.btn{
  padding:12px 18px;
  border-radius:12px;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:800;
  font-size:14px;
}
.btn-primary{background:white;color:#1e1b4b}
.btn-secondary{
  color:white;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.avatar{
  width:280px;
  height:280px;
  border-radius:50%;
  margin:auto;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  font-size:82px;
  font-weight:900;
  color:white;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#4f46e5,#06b6d4);
  box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
  border:8px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
}

section{padding:75px 0}
.eyebrow{
  color:var(--primary);
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:1.5px;
  font-size:12px;
}
h2{
  font-size:42px;
  line-height:1.1;
  margin:8px 0 14px;
}
.lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:750px}

.cards{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:18px;
  margin-top:28px;
}
.card{
  background:var(--card);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:22px;
  padding:25px;
  box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(15,23,42,.07);
}
.card h3{margin-top:8px}
.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
.icon{font-size:30px}

.about{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:24px;
}
.panel{
  background:white;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:24px;
  padding:30px;
  box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(15,23,42,.07);
}

.skills{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:10px;
}
.skill{
  background:#eef2ff;
  color:#3730a3;
  padding:8px 13px;
  border-radius:999px;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:800;
}

.project{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:20px;
  align-items:flex-start;
}
.project:not(:last-child){
  padding-bottom:20px;
  margin-bottom:20px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.project h3{margin:0}
.project p{margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)}
.tag{
  white-space:nowrap;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:800;
  padding:6px 10px;
  border-radius:999px;
  background:#ecfeff;
  color:#155e75;
}

.cta{
  text-align:center;
  color:white;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e1b4b,#164e63);
  border-radius:30px;
  padding:55px 25px;
}
.cta h2{margin-top:0}
.cta p{color:#cbd5e1}

footer{
  background:#111827;
  color:#cbd5e1;
  padding:40px 0;
}
footer strong{color:white}

@media(max-width:800px){
  .hero-grid,.about{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .avatar{width:210px;height:210px;font-size:60px}
  .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .navlinks{gap:12px}
}
@media(max-width:520px){
  .navlinks a:nth-child(3){display:none}
  h1{font-size:48px}
  h2{font-size:34px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
  <div class="container nav">
    <div class="logo">OA.</div>
    <div class="navlinks">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="statistics.html">Statistics</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="badge">Student Portfolio • IIT Madras</span>
      <h1>Hello, I'm <span>Om Adwani</span>.</h1>
      <p>
        I am a student pursuing the IIT Madras BS Degree in
        Data Science and Applications. I am interested in programming,
        data, statistics, artificial intelligence and building practical projects.
      </p>
      <div class="buttons">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projects">Explore My Projects</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="statistics.html">View Statistics</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="avatar">OA</div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">01 • About Me</div>
    <h2>A student who learns by building.</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      My approach to learning is simple: understand the concept, practice it,
      and then use it to build something. Through my coursework and personal
      projects, I am developing a foundation in programming, statistics,
      mathematics and data science.
    </p>

    <div class="about">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>🎓 Education</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Indian Institute of Technology Madras</strong><br>
          BS in Data Science and Applications
        </p>
        <p>
          My studies include mathematics, statistics, programming,
          data handling and other foundations of data science.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h3>🎯 Areas of Interest</h3>
        <p>
          I am especially interested in understanding how data can be
          processed and used to solve practical problems.
        </p>
        <div class="skills">
          <span class="skill">Data Science</span>
          <span class="skill">Python</span>
          <span class="skill">Statistics</span>
          <span class="skill">SQL</span>
          <span class="skill">Artificial Intelligence</span>
          <span class="skill">Machine Learning</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="skills">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">02 • Skills & Learning</div>
    <h2>What I am learning</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      These are the areas I am currently developing through coursework,
      practice and projects.
    </p>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🐍</div>
        <h3>Python Programming</h3>
        <p>
          Working with functions, loops, conditions, lists, dictionaries,
          file handling, recursion, searching and basic algorithms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📊</div>
        <h3>Statistics</h3>
        <p>
          Learning probability, random variables, PMF, joint distributions,
          conditional probability and descriptive statistics.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🗄️</div>
        <h3>SQL & Data</h3>
        <p>
          Practising data filtering, sorting, logical conditions and
          querying structured datasets using SQL.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="projects">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">03 • Projects</div>
    <h2>Things I have built</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Small projects help me turn programming concepts into practical experience.
    </p>

    <div class="panel" style="margin-top:28px">

      <div class="project">
        <div>
          <h3>🎮 Tic-Tac-Toe with Minimax</h3>
          <p>
            A Python Tic-Tac-Toe game where the computer uses the Minimax
            algorithm to choose its moves. This project helped me understand
            recursion, game states, backtracking and algorithmic thinking.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="tag">Python</span>
      </div>

      <div class="project">
        <div>
          <h3>🔎 Mini Search Engine</h3>
          <p>
            A Python project that searches through text files, counts matching
            words and creates a simple relevance score to rank the results.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="tag">Python • Search</span>
      </div>

      <div class="project">
        <div>
          <h3>📈 Countries Statistics Analysis</h3>
          <p>
            A statistics project using a dataset of countries to explore
            population, area and continental distribution using descriptive
            statistics and data interpretation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="tag">Statistics</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#67e8f9">04 • Explore</div>
      <h2>Explore my Statistics project</h2>
      <p>
        Visit the Statistics page to see the dataset, statistical analysis,
        observations and complete country data.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="statistics.html">Open Statistics Page →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <strong>Om Adwani — Student Portfolio</strong>
    <p style="margin:6px 0 0">
      IIT Madras BS in Data Science and Applications
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
